  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Continues XDev.NLog.Targets.Syslog under a new package ID; namespaces and assembly name are unchanged.\n      Fixed TCP on Android: Android was detected as macOS, so keepalive used Darwin socket option\n      values the Linux kernel rejects and every connection failed. Android now uses the Linux values.\n      A failure to apply keepalive tuning no longer fails the connection; OS defaults are used instead.\n      Added support for NLog v6 by replacing SdIdConfig with SimpleLayout",
